{"unit_id":"stark-L-1__dsh-peer-mailbox#feature-1","repo":"stark-L-1/dsh-peer-mailbox","commit":"162a4b9e7c8b5fc6f6d7f324b7d265fd7432bbc5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Peer Mailbox 的功能「投递工作消息」：调用 peer_ask 指定目标和消息，将内容写入该会话的 JSONL 信箱，并返回消息 ID；默认受每对会话的滑动窗口数量限制。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:136-159","lib/index.js:457-473"]}
